# CADDY_WWW_REDIRECT=on (the default): `www.<DOMAIN>` redirects to <DOMAIN>,
# keeping the full path and query, so a session established on one origin is
# never orphaned on the other (the session cookie is host-only). Imported at
# the top level of the Caddyfile. Needs a DNS record for `www.<DOMAIN>`, or
# Caddy cannot obtain its certificate; set CADDY_WWW_REDIRECT=off to drop the
# site when the club has no such record. The alternative is
# `www-redirect-off.caddy`.
www.{$DOMAIN} {
	redir https://{$DOMAIN}{uri} permanent
}
